---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site, disclaimers } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Medical Disclaimer | CheckVitalsNow"
  description="CheckVitalsNow content is for information only and is not medical advice. Talk to your doctor before starting any supplement."
  h1="Medical Disclaimer"
>
  <blockquote>{disclaimers.medical}</blockquote>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on {site.name}, including reviews, comparison lists, health guides, and comments, is for general
    information only. It is not a diagnosis, a treatment plan, or a replacement for a visit with a doctor or other
    qualified health professional. Reading this site does not create a doctor-patient relationship.
  </p>

  <h2>About dietary supplements</h2>
  <blockquote>{disclaimers.fda}</blockquote>
  <p>
    Supplements can cause side effects and can interact with prescription drugs, over-the-counter medicines, and other
    supplements. Talk to your doctor or pharmacist before you start one, especially if you:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Are pregnant, trying to get pregnant, or breastfeeding</li>
    <li>Take any medication, including blood thinners or diabetes medicine</li>
    <li>Have a medical condition or are scheduled for surgery</li>
    <li>Are buying a supplement for a child or an older adult</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Stop taking a supplement and contact your doctor if you notice side effects.</p>

  <h2>When to get help</h2>
  <p>
    Do not delay or skip medical care because of something you read here. If you think you have a medical emergency,
    call 911 or your local emergency number right away.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep our content accurate and up to date and link to our sources, but medical knowledge changes and we
    can make mistakes. If you spot an error, please tell us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
